## Interface: 16001
#
# Base TOC for the WoW: Forever client (1.60.1 / interface 16001).
# The Forever client reports WOW_PROJECT_ID as WOW_PROJECT_MAINLINE, so the
# TOC loader only looks for the base file and "_Mainline" suffixes - a
# "_Forever"-suffixed file is confirmed to not load at all there (silently,
# no error). This file loads the Forever/ code tree (Classic content).
## Version: 1.3.0
## Title: Mik's Scrolling Battle Text
## Author: Mikord
## Notes: Scrolls battle information around the character model.
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\MikScrollingBattleText\Artwork\MinimapIcon
## SavedVariables: MSBTProfiles_SavedVars, MSBT_SavedMedia, MSBT_DebugDiagnostics
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: MSBTProfiles_SavedVarsPerChar
## OptionalDeps: LibSharedMedia-3.0

Libs\LibStub.lua
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
Libs\LibSharedMedia-3.0.lua

Forever\Code\MikSBT.lua
Localization\localization.xml
